{"schema":"tm-fgo-merged-event-v1","recordType":"merged_timeline_event","eventId":"evt-fgo-lb1-U","chapterId":"fgo-lb1-anastasia","rawEventCode":"事件U","orderIndex":24,"title":"兽国的皇女·终章","timeRaw":"2018年4月28日","triggerRaw":"雷帝崩落","completionRaw":"空想树崩毁，异闻带消亡，众人收到彷徨海通讯前往汇合","summaryRaw":"雷帝质问泛人类史生存资格后消逝。卡多克欲启动空想树被击败。阿塔兰忒倒戈，帕茨西为救立香挡枪牺牲。比利击杀阿塔兰忒，皇女为卡多克挡枪消散。神父（拉斯普京）离去。空想树崩毁，异闻带消亡。萨列里留下为雅嘎弹奏钢琴。众人收到彷徨海通讯前往汇合。","sourcePacketFile":"extracted/lostbelt/lb1-anastasia/events/event-U.json","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-093-lb1-anastasia.txt:128-130"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"}
